<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20198" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόει-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόεος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ον </span>(<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόϝεον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Glotta</u>
					4.201
				</span></i>
			 (Apulian vase) is dub.): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦς</span>):—<i>of an ox</i> or <i>oxen</i>,
			esp. <i>of ox-hide</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρμα βόειον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοέοισιν ἱμᾶσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.324
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοείας ἀσπίδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.452
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόεα κρέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.37
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				168
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ β. κρέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					338c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλα β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					218
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				521b33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.83
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδὶ βοείῳ τὸν θεὸν
			ἐλθεῖν</span>, of Dionysus, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.364f
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ῥήματα</span>
			<i>bull</i>-words, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				924
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοείη</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοέη</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δορή</span>), ἡ,
				<i>ox-hide</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδέψητον βοέην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					20.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				142
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοὸς μεγάλοιο βοείην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.389
				</span></i>
			; <i>ox-hide shield</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοέῃς
				εἰλυμένω ὤμους αὔῃσι στερεῇσι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				492
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῶν τ᾽ εὖ ποιητάων</span> (
				contr.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοέων</span>) <i><span class="en">
				16.636
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοεύς, λύσαντε βοείας</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				487
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				503
			</span></i> (s. v. l.).</div>
